---
description: Run Origin git and origin CLI from WSL on Windows
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo remote is Cursor Origin (`https://origin.cursor.com/zechs/google-maps.git`).

Native Windows Origin repo operations are unsupported. Do not install or improvise Origin on native Windows.

On Windows, run every `git` and `origin` command inside WSL. Use the checkout path under `/mnt/c/`, such as `/mnt/c/Users/theem/.cursor/plugins/local/google-maps`.

Git Bash is bash and is the wrong environment. Do not tell anyone to "use bash".

Use the WSL Origin binary. Prefer `command -v origin`. Fall back to `/home/zechs/.local/bin/origin`.

If the CLI is missing or auth fails, follow the Cursor Origin skill.
